     * Action tokens, not --blue: --blue flips to a pale tint in dark mode and
     * would strand white text on white. --action-* stay dark-blue in both
     * themes, which keeps the ~4.5:1 contrast the button needs.
     */
    background: var(--action-bg, #2563eb);
    color: var(--action-text, #ffffff);
    border: none;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
